  "prefLabel": "Mavs 102.01 Terms",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Mavs 102.01 Terms.\n\n(a) \"Adjutant general\" means the executive head of the department of military affairs and veterans services.\n\n(b) \"Department\" means the New Hampshire department of military affairs and veterans services which includes the army national guard, air national guard, the inactive national guard, the state guard, and the unorganized militia, and veterans services.\n\nSource. #13459-A, eff 10-14-22\n\n(c) \"Division\" means a unit within the department led by a director.",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/mavs100.html"
